{"id":"se","lemma":"se","pos":"pron","rank":17,"glosses":["A reflexive or reciprocal pronoun: oneself, himself, herself, itself, yourself; themselves; yourselves; each other; one another","A pronoun used with transitive verbs to create the passive voice","A pronoun used with a verb conjugated in the third-person singular to convey an impersonal meaning"],"ipa":"/se/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-se.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mamá, ¿todavía recuerdas cómo se hace?","en":"Mom, do you still remember how to do it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689511","words":[{"g":"mum, mom"},{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to remember","l":"recordar"},{"g":"how"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"¿Cómo se dice eso?","en":"How do you say that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450487","words":[{"g":"how"},null,{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"¿Cuándo se fueron?","en":"When did they go?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/95832","words":[{"g":"when"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ir"}]},{"text":"Se necesita más.","en":"More is needed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440940","words":[null,{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"more"}]},{"text":"Ellos se la han llevado.","en":"They have taken her away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705360","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"}]}]}